  "description": {
   "en": "Six of the deadliest assassins battle to kill each other!\n\nThe stage is set in the \"dictatorship\" Rokugen Island, located in the western part of Yamaguchi Prefecture. There, the \"battle of the six assassins\" for the country's top position is about to take place...! Will Sifu, a hitman-slayer who has been commissioned to participate in the battle, be able to survive this extreme survival?",
   "ja": "最凶の殺し屋六人による殺し合いバトル！\n\n舞台は山口県西部に位置する”独裁国家”・六篇法国。そこで、国のトップの座をかけた「六人の殺し屋による殺し合い」が行われることに…！！依頼を受け、戦いに参加することになった殺し屋殺しの男・シフは、この極限のサバイバルを勝ち抜けるのか！？"
  },
